  "prefLabel": "Puc 205.04 Request for Notice of Intended Rulemaking Action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 205.04 Request for Notice of Intended Rulemaking Action. Pursuant to the provisions of RSA 541-A:6, III, the commission shall maintain a current listing of all persons having made a request for advance notice of the rulemaking proceedings.\n\nSource. #8657-A, eff 6-10-06; ss by #14184, eff 1-24-25",
